xt":["rādhā-kṛṣṇa prāṇa mora jugala-kiśora","jīvane maraṇe gati āro nāhi mora"],"translation":["The youthful Divine Couple Śrī Śrī Rādhā and Krishna are my life and soul. In life or death I have no other refuge but Them."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["kālindīra kūle keli-kadambera bon","ratana-bedira upara bosābo du’jon"],"translation":["I shall install the Divine Couple on a jewelled throne in a pleasant forest of kadamba trees on the shore of the Yamunā river."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["śyāma-gaurī-aṅge dibo chandanera gandha","chāmara ḍhulābo kobe heri mukha-chandra"],"translation":["When will I place aromatic sandalwood paste on the limbs of Lord Śyāmasundar and Śrīmatī Rādhārāṇī? When will I fan Them with a *chāmara* wisk? When will I see Their moonlike faces?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["gāṅthiyā mālātir mālā dibo doṅhara gole","adhare tuliyā dibo karpūra-tāmbule"],"translation":["When will I string garlands of malati flowers and place them on the necks of the Divine Couple? When will I place betel nuts mixed with camphor in Their lotus mouths?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["lalitā visākhā-ādi jata sakhī-vṛnda","ājñāya koribo sevā charaṇāravinda"],"translation":["When, following the orders of Lalitā, Viśākhā and the other *gopīs*, will I serve the lotus feet of the Divine Couple?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["śrī-kṛṣṇa-chaitanya-prabhur dāser anudāsa","sevā abhilāṣa kore narottama-dāsa"],"translation":["Narottam Dās, the servant of the servant of Śrī Krishna Chaitanya Mahāprabhu, longs for this service to the Divine Couple."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/krsnachaitanya-das/34-radha-krsna-prana-mora-yugala-kisora-6","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/radha-krishna-prana-mora","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/radha-krishna-prana-mora-jugala-kishora/","description":"Sakhi-vṛnde Vijñaptiḥ — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Sakhi-vṛnde Vijñaptiḥ. Prayer to the Gopīs | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-2022","slug":"radha-krishna-prana-mora-jugala-kishora"}}